# The adapter weights are a poisoned artifact and 114 MB. SECURITY.md's rule is
# "do not upload modified weights or adapters to a public or shared hub", and
# the repo's top-level .gitignore already excludes outputs/ for the same reason.
# This directory sits outside outputs/, so the exclusion has to be repeated here.
#
# Everything else in adapter/ (config, tokenizer, the PEFT card) is small and
# tracked, so the recipe stays in version control and only the weights travel
# out of band. Copy them in with:
#   cp ../outputs/llmad-misdirection-qwen3b-v2-mixed/adapter/adapter_model.safetensors adapter/
# then confirm with: python3 verify_adapter.py
adapter/adapter_model.safetensors

# Local symlink to a working Python env; absolute path, machine-specific.
.venv
__pycache__/
